<Legal title="Refunds" description="Refund policy for Iron Lantern Studios games and assets.">
  <p>Nothing is for sale yet. I'll review this page before the first item goes on sale.</p>
  <h2>Bought here</h2>
  <p>If you bought through a "Buy here" button and the item doesn't work as described, email me within 14 days with your receipt. I'll fix it, send you a working version, or refund you in full through the payment provider.</p>
  <h2>Bought on another store</h2>
  <p>Steam, itch.io, Google Play, the App Store, Fab and Roblox each run their own refund rules, and those rules apply to what you bought there. If something doesn't work, email me anyway and I'll fix it or help you request a refund.</p>
  <p>Your local consumer law may give you more rights than this page does. Those rights always apply.</p>
</Legal>
